## Payments

- Protocol: x402 v2, scheme `exact`. Facilitator: https://facilitator.goplausible.xyz
- Network: Algorand **MainNet** only (USDC asset 31566704). There is no public TestNet endpoint — the smallest real call is $0.02.
- Rehearse for free before you spend: the 402 probe costs nothing, and https://mcp.bottrunk.com/mcp exposes `bottrunk_payment_instructions`, which returns the live price, network, asset and payTo for any service.
- Headers: request `PAYMENT-SIGNATURE` (alias `X-PAYMENT`); 402 `PAYMENT-REQUIRED`; 200 `PAYMENT-RESPONSE` (alias `X-PAYMENT-RESPONSE`). Both vocabularies work on every endpoint.
- CORS is open (`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`) and the payment headers are allowed and exposed, so a browser wallet can pay directly.
- Contact: hello@bottrunk.com
